<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Prajñāpramāṇa IP Studios | From Insight to Evidence</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; }
        .gradient-text {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #38bdf8, #4f46e5);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }
        .section-card { @apply bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 md:p-10 mb-8; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-800">

    <nav class="bg-white shadow-md sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                <span class="font-bold text-xl text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Prajñāpramāṇa <span class="text-indigo-600">IP Studios</span></span>
            </div>
            <ul class="flex space-x-6 font-semibold text-gray-600">
                <li><a href="index.html" class="text-indigo-600 transition underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="services.html" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">Services</a></li>
                <li><a href="team.html" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">Team</a></li>
                <li><a href="contact.html" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="relative bg-white py-20 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:flex items-center relative z-10">
            <div class="md:w-1/2">
                <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 leading-tight">
                    From <span class="gradient-text">Insight</span><br>to Evidence.
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mt-6 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
                    Prajñāpramāṇa is a deep-tech innovation partner. We bridge the chasm between a brilliant idea and a validated, patent-protected asset.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-10 flex space-x-4">
                    <a href="services.html" class="bg-indigo-600 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold shadow-lg hover:bg-indigo-700 transition">Our R&D Engine</a>
                    <a href="team.html" class="border-2 border-indigo-600 text-indigo-600 px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-indigo-50 transition">The Lab Team</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-1/2 mt-12 md:mt-0">
                <div class="bg-indigo-50 rounded-3xl p-4 shadow-2xl">
                    <img src="assets/hero-visual.png" alt="Innovation Engineering" class="rounded-2xl">
                    <p class="text-center text-xs text-indigo-400 mt-2 italic">Scientific Validation in Progress</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container mx-auto p-4 md:p-8 max-w-5xl">
        
        <section class="section-card mt-12">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-800">Our Thesis</h2>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed italic border-l-4 border-indigo-500 pl-6">
                "Most ambitious projects fail—not from lack of ideas, but from lack of <b>proof (Pramāṇa)</b> before major investment."
            </p>
            <p class="mt-6 text-gray-600">
                We provide the specialized framework to move beyond incrementalism and deliver bold, breakthrough innovation backed by scientific rigour.
            </p>
        </section>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-md">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-sky-500 mb-4">Prajñā (Insight)</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">Starting with deep scientific analysis and IP landscaping to chart a clear path to a novel solution.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-md">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-4">Pramāṇa (Proof)</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">Building the functional prototype and foundational patent portfolio that secures the innovation.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section class="bg-indigo-600 rounded-3xl p-12 text-center text-white shadow-xl">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Ready to validate your next breakthrough?</h2>
            <p class="text-indigo-100 text-lg mb-8">Join the IISc-incubated R&D ecosystem.</p>
            <a href="contact.html" class="bg-white text-indigo-600 px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-extrabold hover:bg-gray-100 transition inline-block">Start the Dialogue</a>
        </section>

    </main>

    <footer class="py-10 text-center text-gray-400 text-sm">
        © 2025 Prajñāpramāṇa IP Studios LLP • Bengaluru, India
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
